:: Eden Cabin Widgets Wake [widget]

<!-- Eden wakes on schedule and rouses the player, rather than the player guessing a wake-up hour. -->
<!-- Called from Cabin Sleep when _edenCompanionWake is set by the sleep loop. -->
<<widget "edenCompanionWake">>
	<<endevent>>
	<<npc Eden>><<person1>>
	<<set _edenWakeRoll to random(1, 4)>>

	<<if C.npc.Eden.love gte 100>>
		<<switch _edenWakeRoll>>
			<<case 1>>
				You wake with Eden's arm across your waist and <<his>> chest against your back. You can feel each slow breath against your neck.
				When you move under the covers, <<he>> keeps <<his>> arm around you instead of pulling away.
				"You're warm," <<he>> says. "Makes it hard to get up." After a short pause, <<he>> adds, "Morning."
			<<case 2>>
				Eden is awake before you, lying on one elbow and looking towards the window. Morning light has reached the rafters above <<him>>.
				When you open your eyes, <<he>> turns towards you and brushes some hair away from your face, then rests <<his>> hand on the mattress beside your head.
				"You sleep heavily," <<he>> says. "Breakfast. When you're ready."
			<<case 3>>
				You wake when Eden's fingers pull lightly at your hair. A small tangle has formed during the night, and <<hes>> separating the strands with <<his>> fingers.
				"It was in my face all night," <<he>> says. Even after you open your eyes, <<he>> keeps working until the strands are apart.
			<<default>>
				Eden shifts beside you, then looks towards the fireplace. "Fire's gone out," <<he>> says, but <<he>> stays where <<he>> is.
				After a few minutes, <<he>> looks towards you again. "Breakfast would be good." <<He>> still makes no attempt to get out of bed.
		<</switch>>
		<br><br>

		Eden does not hurry you. <<He>> remains beside you, but when you start to sit up, <<he>> looks towards the kitchen.
	<<elseif C.npc.Eden.love gte 50>>
		<<switch _edenWakeRoll>>
			<<case 1>>
				<<He>> gives your shoulder one firm shake. "Up. Breakfast."
				Once your eyes are open, <<he>> lies on <<his>> back and looks at the ceiling instead of getting up to help.
			<<case 2>>
				You wake to Eden sitting on the edge of the mattress and pulling on <<his>> boots.
				"There's wood to split," <<he>> says. "After you've fed me."
			<<case 3>>
				Eden stands beside the bed and looks down at you. "Time to get up."
				When you open your eyes and look up at <<him>>, <<he>> turns <<his>> head away.
			<<default>>
				<<He>> pulls the covers down from your shoulder. The cabin is cold, so you turn slightly and pull your shoulder away from the cold air.
				"Easier to get up when you're cold," <<he>> says. "Breakfast."
		<</switch>>
		<br><br>

		<<He>> stays beside the bed instead of going to the kitchen, watching while you wake up and start to move.
	<<else>>
		<<switch _edenWakeRoll>>
			<<case 1>>
				"Up." Eden nudges your leg through the covers with <<his>> foot. "I'm hungry."
			<<case 2>>
				You wake to Eden standing beside the bed. <<He>> waits until you sit up before speaking.
				"Breakfast," <<he>> says, then turns towards the kitchen.
			<<case 3>>
				<<He>> pulls the blanket away from you in one motion. The cabin is cold, and without the blanket you wake quickly.
				"There. Up."
			<<default>>
				Eden claps once beside the bed. The sharp sound wakes you. "Morning. Kitchen."
		<</switch>>
		<br><br>

		<<He>> stands beside the bed with <<his>> arms folded, waiting for you to get up.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<bedicon "eden">><<link [[Stay in bed|Eden Lie In]]>><<pass 15>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Get up with Eden|Eden Cabin]]>><<endevent>><<loadTempHairStyle>><</link>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

:: Eden Lie In
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<npc Eden>><<person1>>

You pull the covers back over yourself and remain lying down.
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Eden.love gte 100>>
	Eden watches you, glances towards the fireplace and the kitchen, then lies down beside you instead of getting up. When you move closer, <<he>> puts an arm around your waist and pulls you against <<his>> chest.
	<br><br>

	"A while longer," <<he>> says. "Then you're cooking."
	<<set $bedGuest to "Eden">>
	<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<<stress -12>><<trauma -6>><<llstress>><<ltrauma>>
<<elseif C.npc.Eden.love gte 50>>
	Eden raises an eyebrow and breathes out through <<his>> nose. "You're getting bold."
	<br><br>

	Instead of leaving, <<he>> sits on the edge of the mattress and rests one hand on your hip through the blanket.
	"Ten minutes," <<he>> says, but <<he>> makes no attempt to check the time.
	<<npcincr Eden dom 1>><<gdom>>
	<<stress -8>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	Eden stares at you, then pulls the blanket away from your shoulder. The cold air makes you curl closer under the rest of the covers, so <<he>> puts the blanket back over you.
	<br><br>

	"I'll allow it," <<he>> says. "Once." <<He>> turns away and leaves you in bed.
	<<npcincr Eden dom 1>><<npcincr Eden love -1>><<gdom>><<llove>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<nightmareCheck "Cabin Sleep">>

<<generateSleepLinks "Cabin Sleep">>

<<link [[Climb out of bed|Eden Cabin]]>><<unset $bedGuest>><<endevent>><<loadTempHairStyle>><</link>>
<br><br>
